00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.390
relevancy of all the
returned results and use

224
00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:13.530
only the ones we
feel match our original

225
00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.470
query. And I'll demonstrate that in
the next lab. In this lab, I

226
00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:19.050
recommend that you try playing around with
the query expansion prompts,

227
00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:22.110
try your own queries,
and see the types of results you

228
00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:24.170
get by asking different types of
questions about the

229
00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:25.330
Microsoft Annual Report.
